# The Stalker's Hollow (CIPlay stalkers_hollow): the chain's air deck, the lip and its air, the warden's entry, the north
# alcove, the Stalker brought down at one blow (a play's kill skips its phase; on.defeat gives both story items), the east alcove, the valve - played
# without the Spire's RESTORE, so the SEAL answer (the plug, the SEAL note; the bars stay) - the Ringwave plate, the west
# alcove, the last word, the chain back up.
island The Stalker's Hollow
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Deep
expect hidden teal
expect hidden plug
expect hidden lastseal
air chain_air
zone lip
air lip_air
expect step 1
read Warden's last entry
expect step 2
zone sh_ridge
zone sh_cave
read Watchers' post log
expect step 3
read Boat's last log
expect step 4
zone sh_deep
air sh_dair
open Warden house chest
wait 3
expect story sk_crest 1
expect step 5
read Warden house roll
expect step 6
zone alcove_1
air alcove_1
expect step 7
zone arena
kill Angler fish
wait 3
expect story stalkerhurt 1
expect step 8
use hfl1
use hfl2
use hfl3
expect story sh_flood 3
expect step 9
zone alcove_2
air alcove_2
expect story stalker 1
# (reach|valve is counted early: the arena centre lies in valvezone)
zone valve
expect step 12
use valve
expect story valve 1
expect shown plug
expect shown lastseal
expect hidden lastrestore
expect hidden teal
expect shown gatebars
expect step 13
read What the Ringwave means (part 1)
expect step 14
zone alcove_4
air alcove_4
expect step 15
read The last word
expect step 16
zone sh_summit
read Warden's last card
open Lip rock locker
wait 3
expect step 16
zone surface_line
expect done
